  {
    "hotel_id": "79331554",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/manevi-premier-hotel/hotel/hanoi-vn.html",
    "name": "Manevi Premier Hotel",
    "detail": "Had a really comfortable stay here. The room was spacious and clean, and the bed was comfortable. The bathroom was quite large, with a separate WC and shower area, as well as a bathtub. I also liked the fresh, five-star hotel scent of the towels, which smelled like they had been washed with good-quality detergent. One thing to note is that the WC, shower and main bathroom doors are all made of see-through glass, which might feel a little awkward if you’re not travelling as a couple. The smart TV came with plenty of apps, including Netflix and some free video on demand.&#x20; Breakfast was decent, with live stations for eggs and pho, and the breakfast staff were friendly and helpful. However, I would have liked to see more soup options, such as mushroom, seafood or miso soup, as I did not come across any of these during my seven-night stay. The hotel is located in a quieter part of the Old Quarter, but is still within a short walking distance of the night market and Beer Street. One area for improvement is the provision of only one hotel key card per room, which is something I rarely encounter in modern hotels. Having a second card would be more convenient, especially when travelling with someone else. Overall, a pleasant and comfortable stay. I would definitely consider staying here again! ",
